# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and in every working tree,
# including Windows checkouts.
#
# Prettier defaults to endOfLine "lf", and CI runs on ubuntu where the
# checkout is LF anyway. Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites files to
# CRLF on a fresh Windows clone or branch switch, after which
# `pnpm format:check` fails on every file until they are rewritten back.
#
# Binaries (icons, fonts) are detected by `text=auto` and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf